{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-12-16","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：多边形与切线与圆","englishTitle":"Given two circles about the same centre, to inscribe in the greater circle an equilateral polygon with an even number of sides which does not touch the lesser circle.","book":12,"number":16,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.16","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.16/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":16,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-12-16@raw-d1931f328efcd938","contentId":"euclid-12-16","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1931f328efcd938a4d091c7b40ce5d16c3f3db7eca3cbc791aa8d278f305625","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-12-16.statement","euclid-12-16.construction.1","euclid-12-16.construction.2","euclid-12-16.proof.1","euclid-12-16.construction.3","euclid-12-16.proof.2","euclid-12-16.conclusion","euclid-12-16.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-12-16.statement","contentId":"euclid-12-16","revisionId":"euclid-12-16@raw-d1931f328efcd938","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"182a8b3778fba31af0593c0466da1ed3e5fb47ea65beddb88ef8780ad60f7cf8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Given two circles about the same centre, to inscribe in the greater circle an equilateral polygon with an even number of sides which does not touch the lesser circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"鉴于两个圆圈的同一中心,在较大的圆圈中加入一个多边形等量的圆,其边数相等,但不会触及较小的圆圈。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-16.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-12-16","revisionId":"euclid-12-16@raw-d1931f328efcd938","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b0a6312d94a934aa10741d11c2cb826c72ee35850d404a0eaa75770fd432c050","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD, EFGH be the two given circles about the same centre K; thus it is required to inscribe in the greater circle ABCD an equilateral polygon with an even number of sides which does not touch the circle EFGH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCD,EFGH圆圈为同一中心K;因此,需要在较大数量圆ABCD圆圈中加入一个偶数的多边形个圆圈,其边数与圆圈EFGH不相接触。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-16.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-12-16","revisionId":"euclid-12-16@raw-d1931f328efcd938","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a48ef7f5b9239d6db988fd2bf8a35c95c9aac64911fe4f98af8e8079d8f1c8ad","citations":["euclid-3-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the straight line BKD be drawn through the centre K, and from the point G let GA be drawn at right angles to the straight line BD and carried through to C; therefore AC touches the circle EFGH. [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将直线 BKD从中线K划入,从直线 GGA直线从直角线划入直线 BD,再直至C,因此,AC接连EFGH圈。 [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-16.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-12-16","revisionId":"euclid-12-16@raw-d1931f328efcd938","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4087446e26aa3dbfa89a43b4dd671dfa5c19dde3420e5141df9e4b094937679a","citations":["euclid-10-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, bisecting the circumference BAD, bisecting the half of it, and doing this continually, we shall leave a circumference less than AD. [[X. 1](/principles/euclid-10-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,将环形BAD分,将半分,并不断这样做,我们将使环形小于AD分。 [[X. 1](/principles/euclid-10-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-16.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-12-16","revisionId":"euclid-12-16@raw-d1931f328efcd938","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80ad12b092ae933638fb4ec1a07779625f7f5437dd981b2634bfbc64eecf762d","citations":["euclid-3-3","euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let such be left, and let it be LD; from L let LM be drawn perpendicular to BD and carried through to N, and let LD, DN be joined; therefore LD is equal to DN. [[III. 3](/principles/euclid-3-3), [I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将之留作LD;将L-LM划为BD,然后划为N,然后将LD,DN连接;因此,LD等于DN [ [III. 3](/principles/euclid-3-3) [I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-16.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-12-16","revisionId":"euclid-12-16@raw-d1931f328efcd938","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cff2a270c516e46d6c2ba44e16ed678f0c92a910f0e014067cba376ad31be7d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since LN is parallel to AC, and AC touches the circle EFGH, therefore LN does not touch the circle EFGH; therefore LD, DN are far from touching the circle EFGH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,LN与AC平行,AC触摸了EFGH圆,LN触摸不到EFGH圆,LD,DN远未触摸到EFGH圆。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-16.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-12-16","revisionId":"euclid-12-16@raw-d1931f328efcd938","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"455ecf3f58d3fb39688b030c5cd31e678f1e8e6c2f9b74254f725867da8b24f9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If then we fit into the circle ABCD straight lines equal to the straight line LD and placed continuously, there will be inscribed in the circle ABCD an equilateral polygon with an even number of sides which does not touch the lesser circle EFGH. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果届时我们把等于LD线的ABCD直线划入圆圈并连续排列,则在圆圈ABCD线上将标有等值多边形,两边数目相等,与较小的圆圈不相接触EFGH、Q、E、F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-16.source","contentId":"euclid-12-16","revisionId":"euclid-12-16@raw-d1931f328efcd938","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af064bc0b92cd08b8398abb95ba1fc70852b99ee4ffb0c5398823355ecf8474a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.16/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.16\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-16:euclid-3-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-16.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"III. 16, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-16:euclid-10-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-1